# Development and build tooling.
# openpyxl is TEST-ONLY (owner ruling 2026-09-15, landing 2b.10): the
# tests read a twin workbook with an independent reader, so a defect in
# synthtwin's own workbook reader cannot hide behind itself. src/ never
# imports it, the offline scanner keeps it out of the product, and the
# tests that use it skip where it is absent, so the minimum-versions job
# stays green without a pin.
